{
  "info": {
    "name": "Exam Service",
    "description": "Exam Service, Lab 4: players go through the API Gateway (http://localhost:8080), which hands every request to the message broker; service-to-service requests go straight to the broker (http://localhost:8091, /call/exam/...), as Game does. Run 'Auth (run first)' to register and log in a player: the gateway verifies the token, strips it and forwards the player as X-Player-Id with X-Caller: client. Internal requests use X-Internal-Key (INTERNAL_KEY in the team .env, default changeme). Run the Exams folder in order: it creates an exam for the logged-in player against the math professor (Exam asks Zombie and Player through the broker over gRPC), answers it correctly and passes; exam.completed then goes to the broker topic and World unlocks the Math Wing. Operations shows logs, metrics and the 403 for internal routes.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "brokerUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8091"
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "playerId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "username",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "examId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "examSubject",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "examQuestions",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "answers",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "questionId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth (run first)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register Player",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"demo{{$timestamp}}\",\n  \"password\": \"hunter2hunter2\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('username', pm.response.json().username);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Log In",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"hunter2hunter2\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const cookie = pm.response.headers.get('Set-Cookie') || '';",
                  "const match = cookie.match(/access_token=([^;]+)/);",
                  "if (match) pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', match[1]);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('playerId', pm.response.json().id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Gateway Health Check",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Exams",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Exam (internal)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Internal-Key",
                "value": "changeme"
              },
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{$guid}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{brokerUrl}}/call/exam/exams",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{ \"playerId\": {{playerId}}, \"zombieId\": 5, \"encounterId\": \"enc-{{$timestamp}}\" }",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "What Game sends on a professor encounter, through the broker. Exam asks Zombie (zombie 5, the math professor) and Player through the broker over gRPC. The Idempotency-Key is claimed before the exam is created: the same key again returns the same exam, and while the first request still runs another replica answers 409 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_IN_USE."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const exam = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('examId', exam.examId);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('examSubject', exam.subject);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('examQuestions', JSON.stringify(exam.questions.map((q) => q.questionId)));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Exam (player via gateway)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/exams/{{examId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Exam (invalid token, 401)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer not-a-valid-token"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/exams/{{examId}}",
            "description": "The gateway validates the Authorization header itself and answers 401 UNAUTHENTICATED; Exam is never reached and never sees the header."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Submit Answers (player via gateway)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/exams/{{examId}}/answers",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{{answers}}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Answers every question correctly from the internal question bank, so the exam passes and",
                  "// World unlocks the subject's wing (exam.completed through the broker topic). The bank is internal,",
                  "// so it is read through the broker: through the gateway it would be the player's request (403).",
                  "const broker = pm.variables.get('brokerUrl') || 'http://localhost:8091';",
                  "const questions = JSON.parse(pm.collectionVariables.get('examQuestions') || '[]');",
                  "const subject = pm.collectionVariables.get('examSubject');",
                  "pm.sendRequest({",
                  "  url: `${broker}/call/exam/exams/questions?subject=${subject}`,",
                  "  header: { 'X-Internal-Key': 'changeme' },",
                  "}, (err, res) => {",
                  "  const bank = err ? [] : res.json();",
                  "  const correct = Object.fromEntries(bank.map((q) => [q.questionId, q.correctOption]));",
                  "  const answers = questions.map((id) => ({ questionId: id, option: correct[id] ?? 0 }));",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('answers', JSON.stringify({ answers }));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Players",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Exam History (player via gateway)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/exams/players/{{playerId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Achievements (player via gateway)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/exams/players/{{playerId}}/achievements"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Questions (admin)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get All Questions",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Internal-Key",
                "value": "changeme"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{brokerUrl}}/call/exam/exams/questions?subject=math",
            "description": "Admin, service to service: through the broker with X-Internal-Key."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Question",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Internal-Key",
                "value": "changeme"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{brokerUrl}}/call/exam/exams/questions/1",
            "description": "Admin, service to service: through the broker with X-Internal-Key."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Question",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Internal-Key",
                "value": "changeme"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{brokerUrl}}/call/exam/exams/questions",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"subject\": \"math\",\n  \"text\": \"12 / 4 = ?\",\n  \"options\": [\"2\", \"3\", \"4\", \"6\"],\n  \"correctOption\": 1\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Admin, service to service: through the broker with X-Internal-Key."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('questionId', pm.response.json().questionId);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Question",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Internal-Key",
                "value": "changeme"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{brokerUrl}}/call/exam/exams/questions/{{questionId}}",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"subject\": \"math\",\n  \"text\": \"12 / 3 = ?\",\n  \"options\": [\"2\", \"3\", \"4\", \"6\"],\n  \"correctOption\": 2\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Admin, service to service: through the broker with X-Internal-Key."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Question",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Internal-Key",
                "value": "changeme"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{brokerUrl}}/call/exam/exams/questions/{{questionId}}",
            "description": "Admin, service to service: through the broker with X-Internal-Key."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Events",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Exam Topics (broker)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Internal-Key",
                "value": "changeme"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{brokerUrl}}/topics",
            "description": "Exam publishes exam.completed to the broker topic of the same name (from its outbox, in order); World, Game and Crafting subscribe to it through their Discovery registration. Shows producers, subscribers, queue depth and deliveries."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "exam.completed Dead Letters (broker)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Internal-Key",
                "value": "changeme"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{brokerUrl}}/dead-letters?topic=exam.completed",
            "description": "exam.completed events a subscriber refused (4xx) or that failed 5 delivery attempts."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Operations",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Internal Route Called by a Client (403)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Internal-Key",
                "value": "changeme"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Caller",
                "value": "client"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Player-Id",
                "value": "{{playerId}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{brokerUrl}}/call/exam/exams/questions",
            "description": "The broker sends its own key on every call, so the gateway marks a player's request with X-Caller: client. Exam then treats it as the player's: internal-only routes answer 403 FORBIDDEN."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Internal Route Through the Gateway (403)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/exams/questions",
            "description": "A logged-in player cannot use an internal route: the gateway forwards it through the broker marked X-Caller: client and Exam answers 403 FORBIDDEN (routes under /internal/ are not served by the gateway at all)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Metrics of One Instance (Prometheus)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Internal-Key",
                "value": "changeme"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{brokerUrl}}/call/exam/metrics",
            "description": "What Prometheus scrapes from every Exam replica: http_requests_total, http_request_duration_seconds, active_tasks, max_concurrent_tasks, upstream_calls_total, events_published_total and the Node.js process metrics."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Recent Logs of One Instance (internal)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Internal-Key",
                "value": "changeme"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{brokerUrl}}/call/exam/internal/logs?level=info&limit=100",
            "description": "NDJSON, oldest first, from the instance the broker picked (X-Upstream-Instance); X-Log-Oldest and X-Log-Buffered describe its buffer."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Exam Logs (gateway, every instance)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Internal-Key",
                "value": "changeme"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/logs?service=exam&since=15m&level=info",
            "description": "The gateway asks every Exam instance Discovery lists for GET /internal/logs and merges the lines by time; X-Logs-Sources names the instances that answered."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
